@model DigitalniProdukty.Controllers.OwnerController.ResetPasswordInput

@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@inject IStringLocalizer<DigitalniProdukty.SharedResources> T

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = T["Owner.ResetPassword.Title"].Value;
    var email = (ViewData["AdminEmail"] as string) ?? string.Empty;
}

<div class="app-card" id="owner-reset-password">
    <div class="app-card-header">
        <h1 class="app-card-title">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="app-card-body space-y-6">
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-700">
            <span class="text-slate-500">@T["Owner.ResetPassword.EmailLabel"]</span>
            <span class="font-medium text-slate-900">@email</span>
        </div>

        <form method="post" asp-controller="Owner" asp-action="ResetPassword" class="space-y-4">
            @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
            <input type="hidden" asp-for="UserId" />

            <div class="space-y-2">
                <label class="app-label" asp-for="NewPassword">@T["Owner.ResetPassword.NewPassword"]</label>
                <input class="app-input" asp-for="NewPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" />
                <span class="app-validation" asp-validation-for="NewPassword"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="app-validation" asp-validation-summary="All"></div>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <a class="app-btn-secondary" asp-controller="Owner" asp-action="Index">@T["Owner.Actions.Back"]</a>
                <button type="submit" class="app-btn-primary whitespace-nowrap">@T["Owner.ResetPassword.Actions.Reset"]</button>
            </div>
        </form>

        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">@T["Owner.ResetPassword.Help"]</div>
    </div>
</div>

@*
Podrobnosti (k čemu slouží, volání, data, HTMX)

- Účel:
    - Owner UI pro reset hesla vybranému admin účtu (nastavení nového hesla).
    - Email admina je zobrazen pro kontrolu.

- Kdy / jak / kým je volán:
    - GET: `OwnerController.ResetPassword(userId)` vrací view a nastaví `ViewData["AdminEmail"]`.
    - POST: `OwnerController.ResetPassword(ResetPasswordInput)` provede reset.

- Datové napojení:
    - `@model OwnerController.ResetPasswordInput`:
        - `UserId` hidden,
        - `NewPassword` input.
    - `ViewData["AdminEmail"]` jen pro zobrazení.
    - `@Html.AntiForgeryToken()` chrání POST.
    - Validace a chyby přes `asp-validation-for` / `asp-validation-summary`.

- HTMX prvky a princip:
    - View nepoužívá `hx-*`; jde o klasický POST.
*@
